# skill-quality-gate

Apply the skill-quality-gate skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- define and execute dependency-aware quality gates within explicit skill-dev scope
- evaluate structural, behavioral, security, agentic, reproducibility, and artifact integrity properties
- compare immutable baselines and emit evidence-backed release decisions

Stop when: Every required gate is terminal or explicitly BLOCKED/NOT-RUN; policy, baseline, replay, artifact integrity, evidence ledger, SARIF, and attestation checks are complete; verdict is fail-closed.
